         "comprehends": [
          "copies/jk702cg2022.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "ink, read from the lower panel. Six figures written without separators, the first five joined and the sixth after a pen lift: 2, 3, 1, 1, 2, 2. Both 2s carry the same loop, diagonal and foot, so the last figure is a 2 and not a 7. Day first gives 23.11.22. No roll number and no name in this crop."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
